# Angular studio

- Standalone components and signals. This app is built and tested with the Angular CLI (`ng build`, `ng test`).
- Vite+ only runs those commands through `vp run`. Do not move the app onto a Vite Angular plugin.
- Compiler versions are in `docs/adr/001-vite-plus-vs-nx.md`. Do not point this package at the catalog compiler.
- Template typecheck is the `typecheck` task (`ngc --noEmit`). The shared linter does not typecheck Angular templates.
- Task caching ignores `.angular/**`. Keep that exclusion on studio tasks.
- Do not add a package-local formatter config. Formatting comes from the root `vite.config.ts`.
- Run `vp run` from the repository root.
